Source: https://github.com/pmndrs/drei/blob/master/docs/staging/float.mdx

When using the 'demand' frameloop in React Three Fiber, setting the autoInvalidate prop to true ensures the animation continues to render correctly while the Float component is active.

```jsx
<Canvas frameloop="demand">
  <Float autoInvalidate>
    <mesh />
  </Float>
</Canvas>
